      "updated": 1793805051133,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How to use",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to use",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "text-37-q6w22i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1222,
      "y": 198,
      "width": 1060,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1177581751,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 640319866,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793805051133,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Dump domain events first (orange, past tense).\n2. Add the command that causes each event (blue, imperative).\n3. Put the constraint / aggregate between command and event (large pale yellow).\n4. Add reactions as policies (lilac): “Whenever <event>, then <command>.”\n5. Show what people read (green) and who or what acts (small yellow / wide pink).\n6. Park uncertainty in hot spots (neon pink); do not resolve it silently.\n7. Keep one aggregate per transaction; use events, outbox, or a saga across aggregates.",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Dump domain events first (orange, past tense).\n2. Add the command that causes each event (blue, imperative).\n3. Put the constraint / aggregate between command and event (large pale yellow).\n4. Add reactions as policies (lilac): “Whenever <event>, then <command>.”\n5. Show what people read (green) and who or what acts (small yellow / wide pink).\n6. Park uncertainty in hot spots (neon pink); do not resolve it silently.\n7. Keep one aggregate per transaction; use events, outbox, or a saga across aggregates.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 12
    },
